  <metadata><name>Rich Gulch Trail to Middle Bar Bridge — Mokelumne Coast to Crest Trail</name><desc>On-foot hiking route. Dense points trace the actual trail (OpenStreetMap trail data, Nov 15, 2026) so the route follows the footpath, not roads. Simplified to at most 150 points total for inRoute's waypoint limit; the line still follows the trail.</desc><time>2026-11-15T18:40:00Z</time></metadata>
